      "message": "So, AI review pointed out this causes util_est_update() to reference p after dequeue_entities() finishes.   I know with proxy there were a lot of similar races around ttwu races where once dequeued, the task may get woken on another cpu, effectively changing the ownership, and any references I made to it could cause corruption.\n\nIs this not a concern here?",
